{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Ragdoll Rage Game</strong> may look bright, goofy, and harmless at first glance, but don\u2019t be fooled.\u00a0Beneath the silly ragdoll physics and colorful style hides a brutally challenging climbing game where every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e0c5654468e73b866d05b91d0e200530.poster.avif?t=1768846275\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/e0c5654468e73b866d05b91d0e200530.webm?t=1768846275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your patience and skill by grabbing, flinging, and stumbling your way across difficult obstacles.\u00a0The controls may look simple, but mastering them is another story.\u00a0One wrong move can send you tumbling all the way back down\u2026 and you\u2019ll have to decide if you\u2019ve got the determination to climb back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6fa2070f2860b828c3f2d99d0a3ebd4f.poster.avif?t=1768846275\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/extras/6fa2070f2860b828c3f2d99d0a3ebd4f.webm?t=1768846275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based climbing</strong> - Player is completely ragdoll, but precisely controllable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Paths</strong> - Discover hidden areas and unlock exclusive <strong>badges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> - Put your face on your ragdoll and change their look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong> - Unlock over <strong>50+ hats</strong>\u00a0just by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong> - Create your very own levels and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> - Compete for the fastest times and climb the rankings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962540?t=1768846275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/c18c1ee2a32eb1b5fa8d3203b2d33000b9625db4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768846275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/3e9914423648d465acddb7d4102d172b3a27c9a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768846275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962540/3e9914423648d465acddb7d4102d172b3a27c9a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768846275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3973540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Ragdoll Rage Game</strong> may look bright, goofy, and harmless at first glance, but don\u2019t be fooled.\u00a0Beneath the silly ragdoll physics and colorful style hides a 